        "family": "hybrid",
        "variant": "qubit-efficient variational optimization for transaction settlement; hardware-efficient ansatz and register-preserving ansatz",
        "ansatz": "hardware-efficient RY + CNOT layers; register-preserving conditional RY with basis-permutation layers",
